# 📁 `lib/` — Custom Library Directory

This folder is reserved for private, project-specific libraries that follow PlatformIO's recommended structure. While currently unused, this directory can house modularized code to simplify and organize reusable functionality.

## ℹ️ Notes

- PlatformIO will compile any valid subdirectories here into static libraries and link them automatically.
